{
  "component": "p09",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "ALL THREE OUT OF THE HOUSE. FINISHED BY TOMORROW.",
      "record_id": "P09.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL THREE? I'M THE ONE WHO CAN COOK. WHY AM I\nBEING EVICTED IN A SET?",
      "record_id": "P09.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "TAGGED CHAIRS",
      "record_id": "P09.LABEL.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "HOUSE LOT  -  THREE",
      "record_id": "P09.READ.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 7,
      "header_entry": 6,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE CHAIRS, EACH WITH A TAG. THOSE HAD BETTER BE\nTHE THREE THINGS LEAVING. I'LL ASK HIM BEFORE I\nSTART PACKING CUTLERY.",
      "record_id": "P09.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT ARE THE THREE THINGS LEAVING?",
      "record_id": "P09.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CHAIRS. RITA NEEDS THE SPACE FOR HER CERAMICS\nCLASS.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CHAIRS. YOU COULD HAVE SAID CHAIRS.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "I DID. BEFORE YOU STARTED LISTENING.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'RE THROWING US OUT TONIGHT!",
      "record_id": "P09.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CHAIRS, JACKIE. THOSE THREE CHAIRS. NOBODY IS\nTHROWING YOU OUT TONIGHT.",
      "record_id": "P09.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DO ENJOY SAYING THINGS LIKE THAT FROM BEHIND A\nWALL. THE CHAIRS ARE LEAVING SO MY CLASS CAN FIT.",
      "record_id": "P09.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 15,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT WOULD MAKE TONIGHT A SUCCESS FOR THE\nHOUSEHOLD?",
      "record_id": "P09.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CARE FOR THE HOUSE. KEEP THE AGREED GUESTS AND\nNOISE. USE THE COURTYARD RESPONSIBLY.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "AND IN EXCHANGE: THE RENEWAL COMMITMENT, AND YOU\nFUND AND SCHEDULE THE PROMISED REPAIR.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "I PREFER NOT TO PUT IT AS \"IN EXCHANGE.\"",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DO ON RENT DAY.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "VERY WELL. THE RENEWAL COMMITMENT, AND I FUND AND\nSCHEDULE THE AGREED REPAIR. BRING THIS CARD FOR\nTHE TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "RENEWAL AND REPAIR CARD",
      "record_id": "P09.INVENTORY.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "HOUSEHOLD: CARE FOR THE HOUSE; KEEP THE AGREED\nGUEST AND NOISE ARRANGEMENTS. MR. STRINGER:\nCONFIRM RENEWAL AND FUND AND SCHEDULE THE AGREED",
      "record_id": "P09.READ.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "REPAIR. REPAIR DATE: TO BE AGREED AND RECORDED.\nSIGNATURE: MR. STRINGER.",
      "record_id": "P09.READ.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 26,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "OUR DUTIES. HIS DUTIES. SPACES FOR THE DATE AND\nHIS SIGNATURE. IT'S ALMOST INDECENT SEEING HIS\nHALF WRITTEN DOWN.",
      "record_id": "P09.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU BOTH WANT RITA TO HAVE ROOM FOR HER CLASS.",
      "record_id": "P09.CHOICE.004",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU WANT THE CLASS HERE?",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 15,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "OF COURSE. I ONLY DISLIKE MOVING THE CHAIRS.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "I THOUGHT YOU DISLIKED THE CLASS.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 15,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CLASS HAS NEVER ASKED ME TO LIFT IT.",
      "record_id": "P09.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A CHAIR TAG. I CAN LEAVE IT ATTACHED AND ASK\nHIM. BURNING IT WOULD MAKE ME THE ONLY PERSON HERE\nACTUALLY THREATENING THE FURNITURE.",
      "record_id": "P09.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CHAIRS ARE LEAVING. WE AREN'T. I'VE GOT THE\nUNSIGNED TERMS CARD; WE STILL HAVE AN EVENING TO\nPUT ON.",
      "record_id": "P09.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 34,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
    {
      "text": "FIND OUT WHAT \"ALL THREE\" ACTUALLY MEANS.",
      "record_id": "P09.HINT.1",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 35,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE TAG IS HANGING FROM ONE OF THREE MATCHING\nCHAIRS.",
      "record_id": "P09.HINT.2",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 35,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "ASK STRINGER WHAT THE THREE THINGS LEAVING ARE, OR\nLOOK AT THE TAGGED CHAIRS. THEN DISCUSS THE\nHOUSEHOLD PLAN AND TAKE THE UNSIGNED RENEWAL AND",
      "record_id": "P09.HINT.3",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 38,
      "header_entry": 35,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "REPAIR CARD.",
      "record_id": "P09.HINT.3",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 35,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL THREE OUT OF THE HOUSE. FINISHED BY TOMORROW.",
      "record_id": "P09.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 210,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 921
    },
